  ∃ κ : ℂ, κ ≠ 0 ∧ IsAlgebraic ℚ κ ∧ (∀ σ' : ℂ ≃+* ℂ, ‖σ' κ‖ = 1) ∧
  ∀ θ ∈ Th (matH h) (alphaQ (Real.sqrt dK / 2) (matH h)) Λ,
